<title>USA: Griffon Corp to redeem some preferred shrs.</title>
<headline>Griffon Corp to redeem some preferred shrs.</headline>
<dateline>JERICHO, N.Y. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffon Corp said Thursday it had elected to redeem it Second Preferred Stock, Series I.</p>
<p>Griffon said it will redeem all shares of the preferred stock not submitted for conversion into common stock by 1700 EST on March 10 at a price of $10.17 per share.</p>
<p>Each share of the Second Preferred Stock may be converted into one share of common stock, it said. There are about 1.6 million shares of Second Preferred Stock outstanding.</p>
</text>
